{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261119/photo/bkn-20261119081701809-1119_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261119084441\"/><p>香港大學站有信號設備故障。</p><p>港鐵於今晨(19日)8時17分表示，由於香港大學站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛，整體行車時間（總站至總站）預計需要額外5至8分鐘。港鐵人員正在處理。請乘客為行程預留充裕時間。</p><p>至早上8時43分，港鐵宣布早前的信號設備故障已修復，港島綫列車服務陸續恢復正常。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T01:03:55.922066+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":157,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T00:17:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T12:30:29.443849+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T00:57:33.033458+00:00","content_hash":"ad102fd2fff211fa185666c6ea937bbd35c3be00449aa02b280ef7e06bd7e914","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T01:03:55.922066+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}